window.LPAboutContent={eyebrow:"LearnFlow \xB7 Plataforma",title:{es:"About LearnFlow",en:"About LearnFlow"},description:{es:"LearnFlow es una plataforma de ingl\xE9s alineada al marco CEFR (A1\u2013C2), dise\xF1ada para estudiantes aut\xF3nomos que quieren avanzar con estructura y variedad. Combina una ruta secuencial de m\xF3dulos, pr\xE1ctica tem\xE1tica libre y aprendizaje con m\xFAsica real, todo bajo un progreso unificado.",en:"LearnFlow is an English learning platform aligned with the CEFR framework (A1\u2013C2), designed for independent learners who want to progress with structure and variety. It combines a sequential module path, flexible topic practice, and real-music learning, all under a unified progress system."},modules:[{id:"deskflow",mark:"L",markClass:"portal",name:"LearnFlow",subtitle:{es:"Tu progreso combinado, un nivel a la vez",en:"Your combined progress, one level at a time"}},{id:"fluentflow",mark:"F",markClass:"fluent",name:"FluentFlow",subtitle:{es:"Ruta secuencial A1\u2013C2: gram\xE1tica, vocabulario y lectura",en:"Sequential A1\u2013C2 path: grammar, vocabulary, and reading"}},{id:"hubflow",mark:"H",markClass:"hub",name:"HubFlow",subtitle:{es:"Pr\xE1ctica tem\xE1tica flexible con modos de juego",en:"Flexible topic practice with game modes"}},{id:"lyricflow",mark:"LF",markClass:"lyric",name:"LyricFlow",subtitle:{es:"Comprensi\xF3n auditiva con canciones reales sincronizadas",en:"Listening comprehension with real synced songs"}}],author:{initials:"GS",name:"Genil Su\xE1rez",bio:{es:"Dise\xF1ado y desarrollado como proyecto personal",en:"Designed and built as a personal project"}}};
